# The look of the meadow's grass by measure (reports/engine/2026-11-14-grass-system, "Круг правки вида"), in still
# air, from the camera spots of landscape-meadow.bench:
#   mask-<view>   the meadow's ground painted (`grass parts 193`): the area whose tone scripts/grass_look.py reads
#   near-<mask>, far-<mask>   the view meadow-2 and the meadow from afar with parts of the look switched off
#                 (`grass parts <mask>`, Grass::Part of common/graphics/grass/grassdiag.h); 0 is the look, 63 all off
#   calm          3 s of the view meadow-2 in still air: what differs from frame to frame is shimmer
#   cover-<place>-paint, -bands   from the game's camera in two patches: the blades red over the ground painted in
#                 bands of the distance from the camera, and the bands alone
#   OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set> TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh landscape-meadow-parts
# OPENGOTHIC_GRASS_PATCH=22000 makes the whole meadow short grass, 36000 the main one: the cover of each kind.
# @timeout 600
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
walkmode run
watch player
cam game
set time 12 0
cloth wind calm

goto NW_TAVERNE_TROLLAREA_03
clear 3000
face wp NW_TAVERNE_TROLLAREA_05
